COMPILATION OF: E46M10

D: Disk Print
L: List Source Program

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 1

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 2

PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: E46M10

   1 a 0000 E46M10:
   2 a 0006   procedure options(main);
   3 a 0006   /* [E2E-42/P2b] CHARACTER VARYING beside FIXED BINARY, both
   4 a 0006      orders, both routes. E46L3/E46L14 pin the binary item chain
   5 a 0006      (`LHLD / MVI A,09 / ?QICOP / ?PNVOP') and the console already
   6 a 0006      accepts this pair, so the only new thing is the SECOND item
   7 a 0006      behind an attach. */
   8 c 0006   dcl outf file, v char(20) varying, k fixed bin(15);
   9 c 0006   open file(outf) stream output title('M10OUT DAT');
  10 c 0023   put file(outf) list(v,k);
  11 c 0046   put file(outf) list(k,v);
  12 c 0069   put list(v,k);
  13 c 0089   put list(k,v);
  14 c 00A9   close file(outf);
  15 a 00AF end E46M10;

CODE SIZE = 00B2
DATA AREA = 0021
FREE SYMS = 389A
END  COMPILATION
